    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「サボるも何も、夏休みだからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「平日の授業中でもあるまいし、保健室で休んでいる生徒を見咎めるほど僕は狭量じゃないつもりだよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「それに。君は見た目ほど軽薄な子ではないと、僕は知っているからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「君のお父上とは、よく社交場でお会いするんだ。いつも『自慢の娘』だって褒めているよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-track",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-track_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「ど～だか。あたしと親は、関係ないんで。あたしはご覧のとおりの、てきとうなやつです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「それより扉を早く閉めてください、冷房つけてますんで」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-track",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-track_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
