  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「まぁ、そんなことはどうでもいいや。四方先輩は、どうして？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「見たところ、怪我してる感じでもないですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「あっ、もしかして女の子の日ってやつ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-track",
